{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_e07180c244d1","title":"我爱计算机视觉","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667691&idx=1&sn=7188615ec981eedc5dc225bde2118ffb&chksm=979102649ac24ab0f9f6d2c6771110dfa802d10536297da56f2940281d2378499730e98e2614&scene=126&sessionid=1795127016#rd","description":"探寻CV新知，发现AI价值","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"我爱计算机视觉","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM6aYkwkiboia6lA9D7ANy49WBe9icxn5NQqJjvn4Pyntzvfw%2F0","updated":"2026-11-19T13:27:27.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667691:1","title":"狂烧300亿Token、从零手搓108款3D大作！上海创智学院推出首个超长程3D游戏Agent竞技场来了：代码跑通≠好玩，人类盲测胜率差出2.6倍","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667691&idx=1&sn=7188615ec981eedc5dc225bde2118ffb&chksm=979102649ac24ab0f9f6d2c6771110dfa802d10536297da56f2940281d2378499730e98e2614&scene=126&sessionid=1795127016#rd","description":"狂烧300亿Token手搓108款3D游戏！代码跑通≠好玩，真人盲测胜率差出2.6倍","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWibznhdHGicqNLWKltgoWTcd6BxRib9RiazmJ1rOj8mP3MfJgr0Mkjib4ISqcnqxJ4dI1hQaibdhPzMTnxV3eUSumJniaLjy1Ze8rsymk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T13:27:27.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667674:1","title":"TPAMI｜南方科大等提出DepthGS：首度推导深度误差理论上界，高斯表面重建与新视角合成双突破","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667674&idx=1&sn=0b3bc2f0952d63ce9918320eb75ed927&chksm=971ff9460d7db845f9bb76765e33f927e785b6dc0d7e4d0e5a8fdf4da3fa25e35a5d75ba45fd&scene=126&sessionid=1795127016#rd","description":"误差上界破局高斯表面重建","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWibcu3m23ex5sXO7ZmGIUXYCXTUkyTR15PH53CbicY762A4dpfs0gJBlo9Xicgic1Uib5px2uBqxiasjr5nWiaJIkhwWchBr4GpXqcSOU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T15:42:34.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667654:1","title":"直接在像素上生成！PixVid将预训练Latent视","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667654&idx=1&sn=fdbb240aaa24e83d332ba68c591cd1ca&chksm=9702ad5c361a150b66110ad6f89648205cb0a208692099499a7204c5b20ef67e98a4ec907d9d&scene=126&sessionid=1795127016#rd","description":"主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。\n\n分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。\n\nRoblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。\n\n效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。\n\n代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。","content":"<p>主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。<br /><br />分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。<br /><br />Roblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。<br /><br />效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。<br /><br />代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW8t6ibr5JG56yUn9GaJibKR5UUic4d5n5tsyeak97gNhYZV3LTY1HGickd6nmjXerePt51BkM9mOW8niaUhTMnjtVyJ0ORjmGMich3jQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW8YpRIlxicag5micoJ8IA1icxJoGiaD1OibeVKibrcP4W8g6nQDTic4pt4mXYOPkpswcFDV27fZVkiaKDG5L8zYcYAoIWIuUbrbyRYAraU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW8l6Nd3HrhBTIib7BCibQ2DAN46Mr4icgBKoS9XSfNSjMibUoGia8QsaLbgFFjlgEMrH9iaxIlUGvKTMcmORuiakrIia0xadjytsHWIMZ8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/